1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Third Episode
Deadly Challenge
Martial Arts Tournament Volume

15
00:02:07,369 --> 00:02:08,369
Alright, that's enough for now.

16
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,000
That should do.

17
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,580
Ah, I'm exhausted.

18
00:02:45,830 --> 00:02:47,940
What is the matter, Your Highness?

19
00:02:49,050 --> 00:02:50,420
Look at this, Grand Duke Duralumin.

20
00:02:50,830 --> 00:02:52,460
Is there something wrong with it?

21
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:53,860
This is a real sword.

22
00:02:54,155 --> 00:02:56,180
Does this instructor use real swords even for practice?

23
00:02:56,534 --> 00:02:57,600
That is outrageous.

24
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:02,680
I was the one who chose you as a teacher, how could you do such a thing?

25
00:03:03,089 --> 00:03:04,544
No, but...

26
00:03:04,568 --> 00:03:05,681
Get out!

27
00:03:05,904 --> 00:03:06,904
Y-Yes, sir...

28
00:03:08,070 --> 00:03:12,720
By the way, Prince Sapphire, tomorrow is finally the annual martial arts tournament.

29
00:03:14,210 --> 00:03:17,780
Skilled swordsmen from far and wide are gathering.

30
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:24,900
Open up! I have my officers with me!

31
00:03:25,540 --> 00:03:28,106
Whoa, that knight looks incredibly strong.

32
00:03:28,734 --> 00:03:32,600
They are participating in the martial arts tournament by invitation of the Kingdom of Silverland.

33
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,960
Make way!

34
00:03:37,903 --> 00:03:42,900
Ah, ah, ah, wait! Hold on!

35
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:47,100
Wait, I'm telling you I have an invitation, look...

36
00:03:51,480 --> 00:03:54,100
You coward, you failed!

37
00:03:55,670 --> 00:03:59,180
Knight Baron, entering for the martial arts tournament.

38
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:04,920
Here we go.

39
00:04:26,230 --> 00:04:28,160
Looks like I passed.

40
00:04:28,585 --> 00:04:29,920
Wow, that's incredible!

41
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:32,360
A reliable guy has appeared.

42
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:33,920
Give it your all in the match!

43
00:04:34,265 --> 00:04:38,060
He'll beat Sapphire to a pulp and finish them off.

44
00:04:39,490 --> 00:04:40,490
Oh no, this is terrible!

45
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:41,860
They say he's going to kill Sapphire!

46
00:04:42,255 --> 00:04:43,255
I can't just stand around!

47
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:45,813
Little Stork, please!

48
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,460
Whoa!

49
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,940
Doesn't look like I can get in there.

50
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,860
Alright, I'll go inside this.

51
00:05:16,250 --> 00:05:17,350
He's stealing my lunch!

52
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,760
Go on, let me in. I'm Contestant Baron.

53
00:05:28,115 --> 00:05:29,580
Please, come right in.

54
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:31,880
Good work.

55
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:33,280
Yes.

56
00:05:34,205 --> 00:05:35,600
Contestant Guillotine.

57
00:05:35,740 --> 00:05:36,206
What?

58
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:43,460
Oh, so you did show up after all!

59
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:46,015
Oh, it's you. Hey.

60
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:51,160
The scar you gave me is itching to take you down!

61
00:05:51,315 --> 00:05:54,000
Ha, the scar across my face says the exact same thing!

62
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:56,240
I won't let you get away this time!

63
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,480
Same here.

64
00:05:57,600 --> 00:06:00,460
I'm gonna send you to heaven and take the prize money.

65
00:06:00,675 --> 00:06:02,100
What are you talking about?

66
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,880
That's pretty intense.

67
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,240
Ugh.

68
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,640
I am Prince Sapphire.

69
00:06:16,054 --> 00:06:19,393
Thank you for coming all this way for this martial arts tournament.

70
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:24,740
I'll be competing alongside everyone, but please don't go easy on me just because I'm a prince or a child.

71
00:06:25,065 --> 00:06:27,940
I'm much stronger than you all think.

72
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,280
What's so funny?

73
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:47,100
Quite the skill for a kid.

74
00:06:47,655 --> 00:06:49,880
If you laugh again, I won't forgive you next time.

75
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:57,520
Foolish prince, if he angers those powerful fighters, there's no way he'll come out unscathed.

76
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:01,380
It'll be one of those powerful fighters...

77
00:07:04,910 --> 00:07:06,200
The opening ceremony will now begin.

78
00:07:06,650 --> 00:07:09,099
A few words from his grace Grand Duke Duralumin.

79
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:14,660
Competitors, even if your opponent is Prince Sapphire, please fight with all your might.

80
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,100
This is also the Prince's own wish.

81
00:07:20,370 --> 00:07:21,826
Now, for Part 1,

82
00:07:21,850 --> 00:07:23,676
we will conduct three preliminary events.

83
00:07:23,700 --> 00:07:28,759
Those who score 100 points across the
three events will advance to the finals.

84
00:07:28,784 --> 00:07:30,250
Good luck to you all.

85
00:07:50,381 --> 00:07:52,500
Contestant Feister, 91 points.

86
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:54,973
Next is His Highness Prince Sapphire.

87
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,720
Don't go getting 100 points!

88
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,640
If you enter the match, you'll be killed!

89
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,840
Prince Sapphire.

90
00:08:17,365 --> 00:08:18,420
All right, 0 points!

91
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,533
Prince Sapphire, 0 points.

92
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:30,120
No, wait, 100 points!

93
00:08:51,109 --> 00:08:53,300
Contestant Riel, 85 points.

94
00:08:55,819 --> 00:08:57,240
Moving on, the final event.

95
00:08:57,915 --> 00:09:00,240
First up, His Highness Prince Sapphire.

96
00:09:16,049 --> 00:09:17,473
Prince Sapphire, perfect score!

97
00:09:28,759 --> 00:09:30,960
Contestant Guillotine also gets 100 points!

98
00:09:52,677 --> 00:09:53,877
Stop the match!

99
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,120
Sapphire.

100
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,300
Hey, Tink.

101
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:09,240
What's wrong?

102
00:10:09,460 --> 00:10:10,580
You're completely covered in soot!

103
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:14,540
How's that?

104
00:10:14,541 --> 00:10:14,960
Tink.

105
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,120
Aren't I amazing?

106
00:10:16,439 --> 00:10:18,220
This is no time to brag!

107
00:10:19,075 --> 00:10:20,986
Hey Sapphire, doesn't your stomach hurt?

108
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,300
Doesn't your head hurt?

109
00:10:22,635 --> 00:10:24,286
Hey, doesn't anything hurt?

110
00:10:24,515 --> 00:10:26,402
What are you talking about, Tink?

111
00:10:26,427 --> 00:10:29,140
You have to stay out of the finals.

112
00:10:30,565 --> 00:10:31,565
No way.

113
00:10:31,675 --> 00:10:33,315
No, you'll get killed!

114
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:33,960
I know...

115
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:36,527
that Duralumin is trying to kill me in the match.

116
00:10:36,552 --> 00:10:38,186
Then that's all the more reason you can't!

117
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:40,400
All I have to do is win, right?

118
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:43,180
No! I said no! Absolutely not!

119
00:10:47,229 --> 00:10:48,660
At last, it's the final match.

120
00:10:48,684 --> 00:10:51,500
The remaining seven contestants have all earned a perfect score of 100 points so far.

121
00:10:53,369 --> 00:10:55,875
A perfect score... quite a formidable opponent, indeed.

122
00:10:55,899 --> 00:10:56,980
That is correct.

123
00:10:57,400 --> 00:11:02,133
One of them will surely, without a doubt, get rid of Prince Sapphire.

124
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:05,380
However, Prince Sapphire is also quite skilled.

125
00:11:05,605 --> 00:11:07,720
Make doubly sure.

126
00:11:08,206 --> 00:11:09,220
As you can see.

127
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:11,550
How does it seem?

128
00:11:12,119 --> 00:11:16,020
Lord Duralumin likes the kind of person who finishes off their opponent.

129
00:11:16,180 --> 00:11:20,260
Hmph, I make a living traveling from one martial arts tournament to another to earn prize money.

130
00:11:20,380 --> 00:11:21,380
That's reassuring.

131
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:24,260
Now, there's someone I want you to put to sleep.

132
00:11:24,550 --> 00:11:25,550
Who?

133
00:11:25,810 --> 00:11:27,060
You know without me having to say it.

134
00:11:28,195 --> 00:11:30,000
Okay.

135
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:32,640
If things go well, I'll pay ten times this amount.

136
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:33,880
I'll take it now.

137
00:11:33,980 --> 00:11:35,540
You'll keep your promise anyway.

138
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:37,880
See you, Baron.

139
00:11:38,580 --> 00:11:39,901
Hey. Hm?

140
00:11:41,359 --> 00:11:43,420
Baron, you've really fallen low.

141
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,080
What?

142
00:11:45,534 --> 00:11:48,600
Are you really going to kill that little prince just for a bit of money?

143
00:11:50,579 --> 00:11:52,220
Hmph, spare me the lecture.

144
00:11:52,430 --> 00:11:54,000
I'm a ruthless professional.

145
00:11:55,029 --> 00:11:57,860
Then why don't you fight them instead of taking their money?!

146
00:11:59,085 --> 00:12:00,106
Damn it.

147
00:12:00,130 --> 00:12:02,640
Come on, don't get mad. Let's do our fighting in the arena.

148
00:12:06,089 --> 00:12:08,060
We will now begin the final tournament.

149
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:10,272
Although this is strictly a match,

150
00:12:10,296 --> 00:12:12,299
even if someone happens to lose their life,

151
00:12:12,323 --> 00:12:14,020
it will not be considered murder.

152
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:15,799
How can they allow this?!

153
00:12:15,823 --> 00:12:20,480
First match: His Highness Prince Sapphire vs. Competitor Mustang.

154
00:12:22,839 --> 00:12:24,629
Sapphire you're going to get killed!

155
00:12:24,653 --> 00:12:26,160
You don't need to worry, Tink.

156
00:12:28,599 --> 00:12:29,599
Tink, what's gotten into you?

157
00:12:31,404 --> 00:12:33,320
Highness, put on your helmet.

158
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:35,120
I'm fine like this.

159
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:36,700
You insolent fool!

160
00:12:39,259 --> 00:12:40,259
Opal!

161
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:09,126
Come on!

162
00:13:16,629 --> 00:13:17,629
Got a point!

163
00:13:20,919 --> 00:13:24,500
Competitor Baron vs. Competitor Folk.

164
00:13:41,249 --> 00:13:41,901
No good!

165
00:13:43,665 --> 00:13:47,146
Competitor Guillotine vs. Competitor Yabaam

166
00:14:01,249 --> 00:14:02,340
Not this one either?

167
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,660
Next up is...

168
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:07,960
Both of them are no good.

169
00:14:09,149 --> 00:14:10,480
This is practically a slaughter!

170
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:11,860
Are you scared?

171
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,626
Will you quit the match, Your Highness?

172
00:14:13,900 --> 00:14:14,900
Like hell I'll quit!

173
00:14:15,189 --> 00:14:18,131
Your Highness, you don't have to put on a brave face.

174
00:14:18,155 --> 00:14:19,525
What did you say?

175
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:19,940
No!

176
00:14:19,965 --> 00:14:21,366
You mustn't enter the match!

177
00:14:21,391 --> 00:14:22,550
I have it under control!

178
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:23,720
Sapphire!

179
00:14:31,380 --> 00:14:32,380
Sapphire!

180
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,080
What is it, Mother?

181
00:14:35,265 --> 00:14:36,734
I was so terrified of today's match

182
00:14:36,758 --> 00:14:39,100
that I couldn't even bring myself to go watch it.

183
00:14:39,375 --> 00:14:42,800
Please, Sapphire. I beg of you, don't enter any more matches.

184
00:14:43,006 --> 00:14:43,526
All right?

185
00:14:43,639 --> 00:14:45,860
Mother, I am a prince.

186
00:14:46,300 --> 00:14:47,922
If I stop competing halfway through,

187
00:14:47,946 --> 00:14:49,520
I'll become the laughingstock of the entire kingdom.

188
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:50,720
And... and what if...?

189
00:14:51,229 --> 00:14:55,040
I'm going to find the evidence that Duralumin is plotting to kill me.

190
00:14:55,405 --> 00:14:56,405
What on earth are you saying?!

191
00:14:56,780 --> 00:14:58,580
You mustn't say such things.

192
00:14:59,029 --> 00:15:01,880
You just need to focus on studying to become the king.

193
00:15:02,515 --> 00:15:03,969
What would I do if my precious,

194
00:15:03,993 --> 00:15:06,620
precious Sapphire got hurt in a match like that?

195
00:15:07,485 --> 00:15:08,920
Please, listen to me.

196
00:15:11,689 --> 00:15:13,706
Hey, then just tomorrow's finals.

197
00:15:13,915 --> 00:15:15,440
If you let me do that, I'll study.

198
00:15:15,725 --> 00:15:16,725
Just once?

199
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:18,340
Alright!

200
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:19,380
Sapphire!

201
00:15:20,389 --> 00:15:23,306
God, please protect Sapphire.

202
00:15:28,069 --> 00:15:30,520
Now, we shall decide the pairings for the semifinals.

203
00:15:35,339 --> 00:15:37,920
The two who draw the same card will fight each other.

204
00:15:37,945 --> 00:15:39,020
Is that clear?

205
00:16:24,572 --> 00:16:25,400
That's a point!

206
00:16:29,486 --> 00:16:30,393
Head referee!

207
00:16:32,789 --> 00:16:33,789
I scored a point!

208
00:16:37,719 --> 00:16:39,000
Match over!

209
00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:47,220
What?

210
00:16:47,860 --> 00:16:48,660
This is bad.

211
00:16:48,835 --> 00:16:51,911
Alright, call a break. Think of something in the meantime.

212
00:16:51,935 --> 00:16:52,301
Yes, sir.

213
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:57,440
Is it this guy?

214
00:16:57,540 --> 00:16:59,579
 Let's ask him.

215
00:17:00,339 --> 00:17:01,512
How should I put this?

216
00:17:01,536 --> 00:17:03,659
Baron and Guillotine have fought 7 times before,

217
00:17:03,683 --> 00:17:07,220
and all 7 times ended in a mutual hit resulting in a draw, you know.

218
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:07,846
See?

219
00:17:08,156 --> 00:17:08,884
But...

220
00:17:09,769 --> 00:17:10,769
But what?

221
00:17:10,979 --> 00:17:12,900
Without a doubt, it'll be a draw this time as well.

222
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:14,080
What did you say?

223
00:17:14,159 --> 00:17:17,520
It's incredible how both of them went down in a draw this time.

224
00:17:19,139 --> 00:17:23,099
They say both of them are concealing special weapons for today's match.

225
00:17:23,974 --> 00:17:27,399
If both die in a mutual strike, there will be

226
00:17:27,423 --> 00:17:29,219
no one left to finish off the prince, huh?

227
00:17:29,243 --> 00:17:31,160
That's why... we eliminate one of the two.

228
00:17:32,749 --> 00:17:34,160
Is Guillotine not here yet?

229
00:17:35,259 --> 00:17:36,820
Even though it's about to start.

230
00:17:42,029 --> 00:17:43,480
Who is it that wants to meet with me?

231
00:17:44,729 --> 00:17:46,720
What business do you have calling me out to a place like this?

232
00:17:50,509 --> 00:17:52,640
You intend to set me up, don't you?

233
00:18:07,349 --> 00:18:08,720
Why are you targeting me?

234
00:18:09,209 --> 00:18:12,460
Look, we know Sapphire is strong now, so please stop the match already.

235
00:18:12,999 --> 00:18:15,140
There's only the final match left.

236
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,320
So...

237
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:22,520
Here I go!

238
00:18:37,700 --> 00:18:38,700
Look out!

239
00:18:44,999 --> 00:18:47,140
Baron, it's a sneak attack!

240
00:18:51,125 --> 00:18:52,125
A sneak attack?

241
00:18:52,779 --> 00:18:54,700
Who would do such a terrible thing... What?

242
00:18:54,725 --> 00:18:56,140
What! Guillotine ran away?

243
00:18:56,506 --> 00:18:58,660
That's right. He's probably afraid of you.

244
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:00,200
That's preposterous.

245
00:19:00,309 --> 00:19:02,420
Guillotine is a brave and honorable man.

246
00:19:02,999 --> 00:19:05,080
But if he can't be found, it can't be helped.

247
00:19:05,329 --> 00:19:08,140
We will hold the final match against Prince Sapphire right now.

248
00:19:08,804 --> 00:19:09,880
I don't understand what's going on.

249
00:19:10,189 --> 00:19:11,360
I'm counting on you, Baron.

250
00:19:11,479 --> 00:19:12,840
The prize money is 20 times the usual.

251
00:19:13,620 --> 00:19:14,080
Baron!

252
00:19:14,334 --> 00:19:15,553
You killed Guillotine!

253
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:21,986
Whoa!

254
00:19:22,289 --> 00:19:23,289
That's a cowardly move, Baron!

255
00:19:23,579 --> 00:19:25,000
I haven't even prepared yet!

256
00:19:25,090 --> 00:19:26,440
Start of the final match!

257
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:27,926
What did you say?

258
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:28,806
The final match?

259
00:19:28,929 --> 00:19:30,173
It's the final match, you know?

260
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,740
Here I go!

261
00:19:39,129 --> 00:19:40,440
What happened, Baron!

262
00:19:40,724 --> 00:19:41,900
Guillotine ran away!

263
00:19:42,774 --> 00:19:44,320
Guillotine was ambushed!

264
00:19:44,900 --> 00:19:45,280
What?

265
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:46,086
Killed?

266
00:19:46,220 --> 00:19:47,220
No way!

267
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:50,360
Baron!

268
00:19:50,399 --> 00:19:51,480
You had him done in, didn't you!

269
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,000
Ridiculous!

270
00:19:53,219 --> 00:19:55,000
Because you were scared of Guillotine, right!

271
00:19:55,225 --> 00:19:55,920
Baron!

272
00:19:55,979 --> 00:19:57,260
You're a coward!

273
00:19:59,689 --> 00:20:01,080
Killed by someone...

274
00:20:03,309 --> 00:20:04,309
I see...

275
00:20:06,560 --> 00:20:07,240
Hey!

276
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:08,360
Stop it!

277
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:19,680
My God!

278
00:20:38,679 --> 00:20:40,480
It's over...

279
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:41,535
Don't underestimate me!

280
00:20:41,560 --> 00:20:42,560
I won!

281
00:20:42,590 --> 00:20:43,893
I won't lose to anyone!

282
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:44,794
Highness!

283
00:20:44,819 --> 00:20:46,100
Let me tell you this much!

284
00:20:47,369 --> 00:20:48,740
You are completely blind!

285
00:20:51,759 --> 00:20:53,688
At this rate, someone will deceive you before long,

286
00:20:53,712 --> 00:20:55,780
and steal away both your throne and your country!

287
00:20:55,895 --> 00:20:57,275
Don't talk like a sore loser!

288
00:20:58,249 --> 00:21:00,680
At first, I thought about ending your life.

289
00:21:01,299 --> 00:21:02,540
But I decided against it.

290
00:21:02,739 --> 00:21:04,693
So, are you saying you can beat me?

291
00:21:05,279 --> 00:21:07,040
Well, enjoy your conceit while it lasts.

292
00:21:18,680 --> 00:21:19,680
That bastard Baron!

293
00:21:29,889 --> 00:21:31,620
So you finally showed up.

294
00:21:32,359 --> 00:21:34,040
Why did you lose on purpose, Baron!

295
00:21:34,060 --> 00:21:34,780
What happened to our deal!

296
00:21:35,019 --> 00:21:36,600
I'm taking back the money I gave you—and your life!

297
00:21:36,934 --> 00:21:38,666
Unfortunately, I can't give you either.

298
00:21:39,629 --> 00:21:42,473
And now, allow me to avenge Guillotine!

299
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:59,626
Good grief! You bunch of cowards!

300
00:22:02,360 --> 00:22:03,360
Ah!

301
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:07,880
There you are.

302
00:22:08,919 --> 00:22:09,919
You arrogant brat!

303
00:22:10,040 --> 00:22:10,620
I've been waiting for you!

304
00:22:10,939 --> 00:22:12,946
How dare you half-ass our match earlier!

305
00:22:13,059 --> 00:22:14,421
We're fighting for real right here!

306
00:22:14,446 --> 00:22:15,446
Damn you!

307
00:22:16,634 --> 00:22:18,040
That should be enough.

308
00:22:18,464 --> 00:22:19,580
Why won't you draw your sword!

309
00:22:20,420 --> 00:22:20,980
Here I come!

310
00:22:21,260 --> 00:22:22,260
From above!

311
00:22:29,211 --> 00:22:30,004
From above!

312
00:22:33,765 --> 00:22:34,765
Damn it!

313
00:22:37,260 --> 00:22:38,260
Can you even move?!

314
00:22:38,539 --> 00:22:41,700
Before you can even use the sword in your right hand, I'll slice your throat!

315
00:22:43,149 --> 00:22:44,640
This is the skill of a professional, My Lord Prince.

316
00:22:45,849 --> 00:22:48,540
If you don't get stronger, your life is going to be in danger.

317
00:22:49,280 --> 00:22:50,900
You have both courage and wisdom.

318
00:22:51,354 --> 00:22:53,320
But it seems this country is full of bad guys.

319
00:22:53,959 --> 00:22:56,820
To fight them, you must train much, much more!

320
00:22:57,840 --> 00:22:58,840
Well then, take care of yourself!

321
